+- Fight a player as a shadow priest whose estimated lifetime is below the
+  generic PvE eight-second debuff threshold. Vampiric Touch, Devouring Plague
+  and Shadow Word: Pain must still enter the PvP action list in that order;
+  Mind Blast and Shadow Word: Death precede Mind Flay, and wand is last.
+- In a battleground, lose the selected enemy while the core combat flag remains
+  set but no visible target or attacker remains. The engagement state must age
+  out, clear stale target ownership, switch back to the noncombat engine and
+  resume objective movement. Replacing a lost target with another visible
+  enemy must also update the AI current target rather than keep attacking the
+  old out-of-range player.
